{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9ebbecbe7256389449d7bb8a2887ae1cc68c21c26291fe0fa3a9ba9e98963ef8", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nなんだか百合子から、すごいやる気を感じる……）", "zh": "（总觉得从百合子身上感受到了非同寻常的干劲……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "a1a42e9ab81899d4cc0f77a45c45d0877c014fc4ded174f858227f7f5a353096", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今日の撮影は、どんなシチュエーションですか！？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n今天要拍摄的是什么样的情境！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "3614385b92a3353ebf56dc9d4d2bb4eab028e11f06155e30cfe978668f636c06", "ja": "転校生？　それとも、他校からのスパイ？\nもしかして、学校の怪談にでてくる幽霊役とか！？", "zh": "转校生？还是从别的学校来的间谍？说不定是学校怪谈里出现的幽灵角色！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "ec67a3ec30dd85fe1381541e546bf9a1f6e54a2c8a3bac30d71b038c96b80daf", "ja": "あっ、探偵部の部長もいいですよね！\n学園モノといえば、ミステリーも定番ですし！", "zh": "啊，侦探部的部长也很不错呢！\n说到校园题材，推理也是经典元素嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1004_p", "source_sha256": "21d3c47f3db51cc5b0d62210d0fe1eaffd03be8305d5fa5cb1361ca3e742b406", "ja": "お疲れさま、百合子。随分たくさん、撮ってみたい\nシチュエーションがあるんだな……。", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。看来你有很多想尝试拍摄的情境啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "de6c7334375b42626a36210ef127de6f2cde5ae83d37b689e774f6719d8a282d", "ja": "はい！　学校は、物語の舞台になりやすいので。\n様々なシチュエーションが浮かんでくるんです♪", "zh": "是的！学校很容易成为故事的舞台，所以各种各样的情境都会浮现出来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2c7cc506172c46f407da96d9704289de66d16ca3bd874309e68d76450c3efdf6", "ja": "確かに、学校を舞台にした作品はたくさんあるな。\nでも写真だけで伝えるのは、難しい気も……。", "zh": "确实，以学校为背景的作品有很多呢。\n不过只靠照片来传达，感觉还是有些难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "0c54b2f9aa0b6c4d5f24ca2d01a648911e4550df4f2a37e9128b80933fcc42fc", "ja": "あっ……そうですね。素敵なシチュエーションも、\n魅力がちゃんと伝わらないと、意味がないですし。", "zh": "啊……确实是这样。即使是很棒的场景，\n如果无法充分传达它的魅力，也就没有意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "d3c8051e4a92b7849d1947e5f3f6bc102d81c4c78aabf36ddadfc907da749adf", "ja": "でも、せっかく学校での撮影ですから！　学校が持つ\nポテンシャルを、伝えたいんですけど……うーん……。", "zh": "不过，难得是在学校拍摄！所以我想把学校本身的潜力展现出来，可是……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0912bf51c0110cf76bb588c0c073b6b52019dd82d596e3170aea810d6c000efb", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。その考えはよくわかるけど、\nここは普段どおりの百合子でいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "对、对啊……我很理解你的想法，不过在这里，做平时的百合子不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bacdedf15b13c08801c4423c7d60bdcc5644edf265e4cc2b3ca58fc6a0bf645f", "ja": "みんな、アイドルとしての百合子は知ってても、\n学校にいる普段の百合子の事は知らないはずだし。", "zh": "大家虽然知道作为偶像的百合子，\n但应该不知道在学校时平时的百合子是什么样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "1e5183df281c678471f668bad858c42af06dc17a0d9f8d28e4cd5f19cc28d251", "ja": "あっ、なるほど！　たしかに、そうかもしれませんね。\nそういうことほど、知らないかも……。", "zh": "啊，原来如此！确实，可能是这样呢。\n这种事情，说不定反而不知道……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "a17d99de9aeed0dcac71de9b77c97687be735d3425cff5d0d1d6131725dc94c2", "ja": "毎日、図書室で読書をしたり。\n明日の数学のテストのことで、悩んだり……。", "zh": "每天在图书室里读读书，\n又会为明天的数学考试烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "c0bfd251b2975b45ab5646c3e4e6c53fe45407e76df2073bb26746ce88dc46fe", "ja": "つまり『日常系ストーリーの中にいる私』ですね！", "zh": "也就是说，我就是《日常系故事》里的我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "4936377e58c58dfc436aba37dff072d71c6a5f1da621f2354529abecd4a95c92", "ja": "学校を舞台にした日常系は、王道ですから！\n面白い作品が、たくさんありますし……。", "zh": "以学校为舞台的日常系可是王道呢！\n而且有好多有趣的作品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "8527a7ba06a799381647735cc4e24fc54fc5055ea7860b8b6451cc103ff84b46", "ja": "さすが、{$P$}さんです！\n私、日常っぽさを表現できるよう、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生！\n我会努力表现出日常感的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0193_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c1c2084b3746f390c9468b28ac5eaee6bddf73110048d641b9ccc5067ecf787d", "ja": "（そういう意味で言ったわけじゃないんだけど……\nこれはこれで上手くいきそうだから、いいか！）", "zh": "（我不是那个意思……\n不过这样好像也能顺利进行，那就算了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
